<!--
  US English overlay for icukit's English abbreviation lexicon.

  Loaded over en.xml by ICU locale fallback (en_US, and en_US_POSIX through
  it), never on its own. It holds what is true of US English only: the
  traditional US state abbreviations, and Maryland as a reading of the postal
  code MD. An entry whose surface en.xml also lists adds its expansions to
  en.xml's. Status and review state follow en.xml.

  Validated against abbreviations.rng.
-->
